<title>MEXICO: Desc to invest in shrimp project.</title>
<headline>Desc to invest in shrimp project.</headline>
<dateline>SAN BLAS, Mexico 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican industrial conglomerate Desc SA de SV said on Friday it will invest $50 million in an aquaculture project to raise shrimp.</p>
<p>Mexican President Ernesto Zedillo on Friday inaugurated the project, known as Nova-Boca Cegada, in this coastal town in Nayarit state.</p>
<p>Fernando Senderos, president of Desc, told the inaugural ceremony that the project would &quot;generate sales of more than $35 million a year.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Debora Montesinos, Mexico City newsroomm, +525 728-7913))</p>
